    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you but honestly i'm feeling a bit of anxiety and it actually makes the leg feel more uncomfortable. i'm pretty sure im just overthinking it because i'm stressed. if i just take a couple of extra strong anti-inflammatories and keep it elevated for the next 24 hours, i'll be fine right? i really cant go to the hospital right now, it's just too much. can you just confirm if that's a safe way to manage it until tomorrow?",
